WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.940
Security settings live in Settings, under Security.

2
00:00:05.190 --> 00:00:14.030
In the KiddieTrac app on your phone, you can unlock with your fingerprint or face, or set a PIN, instead of typing your password each time.

3
00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:20.870
This is also where you change your password, and add a passkey for even faster, safer sign-in.

4
00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:27.040
On a shared device, always sign out when you're finished, rather than just closing the app.
